Engage an external consultancy to conduct a comprehensive salary review of all staff in order to inform your decision making at the next salary review.',2),(792,135,'Notify staff that salaries will be based purely on performance in the future, redistribute the organisation''s competency framework to ensure everyone understands what high performance looks like',4),(793,135,'Develop a salary banding against the organization''s competency framework, with levels of salary aligned to desired behaviours. Publicise this framework and levels while redesigning the salary review process to align with the framework',5),(794,136,'Strongly Disagree',0),(795,136,'Somewhat Disagree',1),(796,136,'Mildly Disagree',2),(797,136,'Mildly Agree',3),(798,136,'Somewhat Agree',4),(799,136,'Strongly Agree',5),(800,137,'Strongly Disagree',0),(801,137,'Somewhat Disagree',1),(802,137,'Mildly Disagree',2),(803,137,'Mildly Agree',3),(804,137,'Somewhat Agree',4),(805,137,'Strongly Agree',5),(806,138,'Strongly Disagree',0),(807,138,'Somewhat Disagree',1),(808,138,'Mildly Disagree',2),(809,138,'Mildly Agree',3),(810,138,'Somewhat Agree',4),(811,138,'Strongly Agree',5),(812,139,'Strongly Disagree',0),(813,139,'Somewhat Disagree',1),(814,139,'Mildly Disagree',2),(815,139,'Mildly Agree',3),(816,139,'Somewhat Agree',4),(817,139,'Strongly Agree',5),(818,110,'110-a.png',5),(819,110,'110-b.png',0),(820,110,'110-c.png',0),(821,110,'110-d.png',0),(822,110,'110-e.png',0),(823,128,'128-a.png',0),(824,128,'128-b.png',5),(825,128,'128-c.png',0),(826,128,'128-d.png',0),(827,128,'128-e.png',0),(828,135,'Inform the employees that there will be an audit to ensure that raises were given based on appropriate conditions. If conditions for raises were not met, salaries may be re-adjusted',0),(829,111,'Do your research and open a case with HR. This is unacceptable behaviour from a leader and their team and this type of behaviour and  lack of ethics must be stopped immediately',0),(830,122,'If by next week the whole team isn''t trained and using the system, allow both system to operate simultaneously and eventually transfer the records over to the accurate system',0),(831,14,'Let the company know that you would like to take on the project and bid for it, but you have no experience and cannot promise outcomes but you will give them a better deal then the rest',0),(832,110,'110-f.png',0),(833,128,'128-f.png',0),(834,129,'Due to your knowledge of the market, and experience dealing with several issues such as this, you inform the client not to panic. You have managed several scenarios such as this and have always been successful in winning for client no matter who is at fault',0);
